            </note>
            <note corresp="#d12-f3" n="3" xml:id="d12-f3-content">
                <p> NSC Action No. 471, taken by the National Security Council at its 91st Meeting,
                    May 16, recorded NSC adoption of the present report. It also specified that the
                    NSC would recommend to President Truman that should he approve the report, he
                    should agree to its superseding certain other NSC series as indicated in the
                    third paragraph below. (S/S Files: Lot 62D1: NSC Actions)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d12-f4" n="4" xml:id="d12-f4-content">
                <p>Neither printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d12-f5" n="5" xml:id="d12-f5-content">
