                        <hi rendition="#italic">ibid</hi>., 1949, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >vii</hi>, Part 2, p. 730</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d12-f6" n="6" xml:id="d12-f6-content">
                <p> NSC 22, a report titled “Possible Courses of Action for the U.S. With Respect to
                    the Critical Situation in China,” July 26, 1948, and NSC 22/1, August 6, 1948,
                    same title, are printed in <ref target="frus1948v08#pg_118">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">ibid</hi>., 1948, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >viii</hi>, pp. 118</ref> and <ref target="frus1948v08#pg_131"
