                        target="frus1948v08#pg_231">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">ibid</hi>., p. 231</ref>. NSC 22/3, same title,
                    February 2, 1949, is printed in <ref target="frus1949v09#pg_479">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">ibid</hi>., 1949, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
